@startuml
title 小組活動與逐題搶答 - 主要流程
actor Teacher
actor Leader
actor Member
participant Client
participant "Express Services" as API
participant "WebSocket Presence" as WS
database SQLite as DB
participant "Sheets Gateway" as Sheets

Teacher -> Client : sign in and create activity
Client -> API : configured credentials / create
API -> DB : validate owner; persist activity
API --> Client : activity join code

Leader -> Client : join activity; create group
Client -> API : leader session + activity code
API -> DB : generate random six-digit code
API -> DB : unique (activity, code); enforce 100 groups
API --> Client : invite code
Member -> Client : enter activity code + invite code
Client -> API : member join
API -> DB : count active sessions; enforce max 2
API --> Client : shared group identity

par student socket reconnect window
  WS -> DB : last socket closes; set deadline now + 2m
  WS -> DB : reconnect before deadline; clear deadline
else expiry
  WS -> DB : deadline expires; retire session and release seat
end

par teacher end and question submissions
  Leader -> Client : submit one question only
Client -> API : complete answer request
API -> DB : allocate activity receipt sequence
API -> DB : validate and save first group/question answer
API --> Client : own group acknowledgment only
Teacher -> Client : end activity
Client -> API : ordered end request
API -> DB : same queue assigns end receipt; freeze results
end

par teacher disconnected grace
  WS -> DB : teacher last socket closes; deadline now + 2m
  WS -> DB : owner reconnect clears deadline
else timeout or explicit teacher leave
  API -> DB : ordered end; freeze results and publish final phase
end

API -> Sheets : write winners; skip no-winner cells
Sheets --> API : success or retryable failure
API --> Teacher : immutable results / export status
Teacher -> API : retry failed/unknown export by ID
API -> Sheets : reread source and final snapshot; safe new attempt
Student -> Client : reload final results
Client -> API : activity code only; ended result query
API --> Client : final result snapshot
@enduml
